---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Wild Landscape Co. is a Sunshine Coast garden design and landscaping team focused on outdoor spaces that fit how you live."
  path="/about"
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold">About Wild Landscape Co.</h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-moss-600">
      We're a Sunshine Coast–based team designing and building gardens that
      hold up to real life — kids, pets, entertaining, and the sub-tropical
      climate that comes with living here.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-moss-600">
      Replace this placeholder copy with the studio bio, team photos, and
      process details from the current Framer site during content
      migration. Suggested sections: our approach/process, the team, and
      why Sunshine Coast clients choose us.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-moss-800">10+</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-moss-500">Years designing local gardens</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-moss-800">100+</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-moss-500">Projects completed</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-moss-800">Sunshine Coast</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-moss-500">Where we work</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
